alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:CONT_Goblins_Chest_A\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">b771aebb-e089-49a9-9bf6-471a00345afc</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:b771aebb-e089-49a9-9bf6-471a00345afc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:b771aebb-e089-49a9-9bf6-471a00345afc\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>By the fireplace in the <a href=\"/wiki/Gnarled_Teahouse\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gnarled Teahouse\">Gnarled Teahouse</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-65&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;267</span></li>\n<li>At the checkpoint on the way to the <a href=\"/wiki/Goblin_Camp\" title=\"Goblin Camp\">Goblin Camp</a>, next to <a href=\"/wiki/Tracker_Bal\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Tracker Bal\">Tracker Bal</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-84&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;346</span></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Passive_features\">Passive features</span></h2>\n<p>Crude Chest has 50 <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\">Hit Points</a>.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width: 62%;\">\n<caption>Resistances</caption>\n<tbody><tr><td><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.pn